###### List all roasts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/roasts

###### Get one roast
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/roasts/1

###### Create a roast
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/roasts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Yirgacheffe",
    "origin": "Ethiopia",
    "roastLevel": "LIGHT",
    "price": 14.99,
    "tastingNotes": "Floral, citrus"
}

###### Update a roast
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/roasts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Yirgacheffe Reserve",
    "origin": "Ethiopia",
    "roastLevel": "MEDIUM",
    "price": 16.99,
    "tastingNotes": "Blueberry, wine"
}

###### Delete a roast
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/roasts/1

###### Generate tasting notes with a local Ollama model (requires `ollama serve` running)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/roasts/1/tasting-notes/generate
